924 0 obj
<<
/A 3082 0 R
/Alt (Bar chart comparing the selectivity index of the Verbesina arbusculin derivative \(V. lanata\) and meglumine antimoniate. The Verbesina-derived compound shows a high selectivity index of up to 88.2, whereas meglumine antimoniate shows a selectivity index of 40.0. The comparison highlights the more favorable balance between antiparasitic activity and host-cell toxicity of the Verbesina-derived scaffold and illustrates its greater translational potential.)
/K [35 3083 0 R]
/P 281 0 R
/Pg 79 0 R
